hadiths[3]{hadithnumber,text}:
"139","Allāhumma innā naj`aluka fī nuḥūrihim wa na`ūdhu bika min shurūrihim. ¤ ---------------------------------¤ O Allah, we ask You to restrain them by their necks, and we seek refuge in You from their evil."
"140","Allāhumma anta `aḍudī, wa anta naṣīrī, bika ajūlu, wa bika aṣūlu, wa bika uqātil. ¤ ---------------------------------¤ O Allah, You are my strength and You are my support. For Your sake, I go forth and for Your sake, I advance and for Your sake, I fight."
"141","Ḥasbunallāhu wa ni`mal-wakīl. ¤--------------------------------- ¤ Allah is sufficient for us and the best of those on whom to depend."
